# README media and linked licenses are pinned to this package version.
# The on-screen pictures (install-output-*, doctor-output-*, ignition-toast-*,
# planner-permissions-*), the status card and automatic handoff pictures (status-card-*, auto-handoff-*) and the
# promo film (promo-*, promo-source/) are shown only by the GitHub pages, so the docs/assets/readme/* rule below
# keeps them out of the package.
